lt 2","main":"Burn","main_info":{"icon":"UC-Burn.webp","key":"Burn","tier":"UC","label":"Burn","value":"15% chance"},"sub":"Poison","sub_info":{"icon":"UC-Poison.webp","key":"Poison","tier":"UC","label":"Poison","value":"15% chance"}},{"label":"Alt 3","main":"Poison","main_info":{"icon":"UC-Poison.webp","key":"Poison","tier":"UC","label":"Poison","value":"15% chance"},"sub":"Bleed","sub_info":{"icon":"UC-Bleed.webp","key":"Bleed","tier":"UC","label":"Bleed","value":"15% chance"}}]}],"dedicated":{"name":"Karon's Miraculous Deer Antler","main_stat":"MATK +247","icon":"Karon.webp","a":[{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATK%25.webp"},{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATK%25.webp"},{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATK%25.webp"},{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATK%25.webp"}],"b":[{"name":"Resilience","value":"+15%","icon":"Resilience.webp"},{"name":"Resilience","value":"+15%","icon":"Resilience.webp"},{"name":"Resilience","value":"+15%","icon":"Resilience.webp"},{"name":"Resilience","value":"+15%","icon":"Resilience.webp"}],"second":"no","why_by_stat":{"AllATK%":"Karon benefits from having high Attack to boost his heals more. However, just be careful not to get his Attack more than the actual DPSs in the team."},"story":"\"Do not worry. Just as a tree sheds its leaves only to sprout new buds once more, my horn will also grow back in time in accordance to the natural cycle of life.\"\n\nA young child wandered through the Mystic Woods, desperately searching for the medicinal herbs needed to cure their ailing parents. Karon's heart went to the child, and without hesitation he broke off  a radiant horn from his own temple and placed it in the child's small, outstretched hands. As the child stood frozen in astonishment by this compassionate gesture, Karon gently patted the child's head and offered a benevolent smile."},"used_in":[{"tip":"Raid: Ox King","cat":"pve","banner":"RAID_OX.webp"},{"tip":"Adventure (Both)","cat":"pve","banner":"ADVENTURE_BOTH.webp"},{"tip":"Infinite Tower","cat":"pve","banner":"INFINITE_TOWER.webp"},{"tip":"Sudden Raid: Astrea","cat":"pve","banner":"RAID_SUDDEN_ASTREA.webp"},{"tip":"Tower of Trials","cat":"pve","banner":"TOWER_OF_TRIALS.webp"},{"tip":"Power Up Dungeon","cat":"pve","banner":"PU_DUNGEON.webp"}],"lore":"Karon is a spirit that guards the Mystic Tree, the largest tree and the namesake of the Mystic Woods.\nKaron is stubborn and follows the rules of nature to a fault. This adamant adherence to natural law led him to try to persuade Snipper to abandon his quest for vengeance.\nDespite his young and rather handsome appearance, he has wisdom and calm far beyond that of any human. He's looked up to as the elder of the forest.\nHe occasionally meets with Rudy and Evan, and he sometimes receives their help dealing with the odd monster attack.\nHe's also good friends with Jupy, since they're from the same place. She's the one who introduced him to Snipper, who has made it a habit to regularly visit Karon. Despite wanting peace and quiet so he can meditate without interruption, he has developed a sizable list of frequent visitors."}